== webview2-gtk API - Package Overview ==

GTK 4 widget embedding Microsoft Edge WebView2 on Windows, plus
{{{Win32Atspi}}} (AT-SPI-shaped accessibility over UI Automation).

Public namespaces:

 * {{{WebView2Gtk}}} — {{{WebView}}} and related types (WebKitGTK-shaped API)
 * {{{Win32Atspi}}} — accessibility tree / actions / keyboard synth

Hand-written notes: [[https://github.com/roojs/webview2-gtk/blob/main/docs/a11y.md|docs/a11y.md]].

